// The WASI host's interfaces, tested (yelc test tests/host): natively through std's host
// (runtime/std/core/host/host-*.yel, the runtime's C), as a component through the host's own
// (tools/test-component.sh, the network and name lookups granted: WASMTIME_FLAGS), the same tests
// either way. Each file a part: imports.yel (cli, random, clocks), waits.yel (the host's clock
// waited for), resources.yel (handles), filesystem.yel, tcp.yel, dns.yel. What a process's stdin,
// stdout and exit do is tested where they are the program's own: tests/cat.yel, tests/stdin-drop.yel,
// tests/exit.yel
